11
00:58:03,333 --> 00:58:09,333
Teen Beach Movie is a 2013 American musical teen romantic comedy
film released as a Disney Channel Original Movie.

12
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
Directed by Jeffrey Hornaday and written by Vince Marcello, Mark
Landry, Robert Horn, it was filmed in Puerto Rico.

13
01:08:36,666 --> 01:08:42,666
The movie premiered on July 19, 2013, on Disney Channel
and stars Ross Lynch and Maia Mitchell.

14
01:13:53,333 --> 01:13:59,333
Teen Beach Movie was the only Disney Channel Original Movie to premiere in 2013.

15
01:19:10,000 --> 01:19:16,000
A sequel, Teen Beach 2, premiered on June 26, 2015.

16
01:24:26,666 --> 01:24:32,666
The film explores themes of surfer, time travel,
musical, film in film, teen movie.

17
01:29:43,333 --> 01:29:49,333
The tone is lighthearted.
